# Input default (LOCKED)

When creating an input, use the lock in `src/Products/PinoyBusinessPOS/ExItS.PinoyBusinessPOS.React/src/features/ui-standards/input-global-default.ts`.

The locked command is `ext input primary outlined`: intent `INPUT_GLOBAL_DEFAULT_INTENT` and appearance `INPUT_GLOBAL_DEFAULT_APPEARANCE`. Shape and density stay Standard unless the user names them.

The Form Components submenu **Input** playground has a lock labeled **default global**. That lock is what a new input is expected to use.

Use the locked ExItS input. Do not pick a different intent or appearance unless the user names one.
